+  - adr: "037"
+    why: >
+      The trace of each decision, its check, and the review tool's five sections stand. Its
+      Affects line names the old Phoenix place (`~/.garura/phoenix-memory/...`), but that is a
+      record of what it touched then; it needs no pointer.
+  - adr: "029"
+    why: >
+      Drives run plays in order. Nothing in ADR 029 says a drive reads memory. The rule that a
