+      what: tests for the pull and the old place
+    - path: core/tools/memory/contract/v4.json
+      what: "lists `pull` and `pulled`, and says Garura memory 'holds the subset of Phoenix memory the project pulled'; the contract drops both commands (which contract version is not decided here)"
+    - path: core/tools/memory/GUIDE.md
+      what: "line 13 says Garura memory holds 'what it pulled from Phoenix memory'; line 35 says a file read from Phoenix memory is saved into Garura memory"
