+      what: name `.garura/tools/` and `~/.garura/phoenix-memory` today; the install also lays the common close file beside the plays
+    - path: core/components/plays/uninstall-garura/scripts/uninstall.py and core/components/plays/uninstall-garura/SKILL.md
